sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Game (Bevy App)
  participant P as NoeticPlugin systems
  participant C as noetic_core
  participant A as Game animation
  G->>P: FixedUpdate
  P->>P: Sync: read WaterSource, Burrow, Player… into WorldViewCache
  P->>C: Think (round robin, think_hz): needs, perceive, memory, fear
  C->>C: threat_branch / choose_activity (seeded Rng)
  P->>C: Act: run_step, locomotion (every frame)
  C-->>P: SimEvents (Anim, Alarm, Death)
  P-->>A: NoeticAnimEvent{entity, event, clip, looping}
